==Battleground==
*3 [[Doge Dark]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 13.33~16.67 seconds<sup>400f~500f</sup>.
*5 [[Inky Doge]]s spawn after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>, delay 10~13.33 seconds<sup>300f~400f</sup>.
*1 [[Gory Dark]] spawns after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Blinky Kory]] spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[Inky Doge]]s spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 16.67~23.33 seconds<sup>500f~700f</sup>.
**1 [[Kang Roo]] spawns after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>.
**1 [[Gory Dark]] spawns after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Doge Dark]]s spawn, delay 13.33~16.67 seconds<sup>400f~500f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Blinky Kory is not a formidable enemy here, as his [[Mini-Wave]]s can be tanked easily by [[Fish Cat (Normal Cat)|Whale Cat]] and don't deal enough damage to bother sturdier meatshields like [[Tank Cat (Normal Cat)|Wall Cat]]. Simply use [[Valkyrie Cat (Special Cat)|True Valkyrie Cat]] to clear the way for your Whales to wreak havoc.

